  "instructions": [
    "In a 3-quart saucepan, brown the meat for 5 minutes on each side. Remove from the saucepan.",
    "Place the prepared vegetables in the saucepan with ½ cup of water and simmer over low flame until soft.",
    "Add the cranberry sauce and marinara to the veggies and heat until bubbly. Add the garlic.",
    "Place the meat in the pot and simmer over low flame for 1½ to 2 hours. Allow the meat to cool and then slice.",
    "Return the slices to the pot and warm. Everyone enjoys this cranberry pot roast!"
  ],
